~ start
Mina: [$> Global.expression = 'happy'] Hello, Violet 
Mina: What would you like to talk about?
- day
	=> day
#- random [$> Global.happiness += 5]
- open up 
	=> open_up
- ignore

=> END

~ day
% 
	Mina: ...
	- We went to the mall after school today
		Mina: ...
		- they started selling some blind boxes for this game Christine's really into
			Mina: ...
			- she started freaking out!
				Mina: ...
				- I've never seen her this excited about smth, so it was really funny!
					Mina: ...
					- especially given how... composed she is, ig
						Mina: ...
						- I don't think she got a good character though...
							Mina: ...
							- she opened it, and was like 'oh...'
								Mina: ...
								- we all just laughed about it and move on
									Mina: ...
									- I might check out the game, since it means a lot to her
										Mina: ...
										- anyway, that was my day
	Mina: ...  [$> Global.happiness += 10]
	Mina: Wow! you seem to have had a really fun day today!!
	Mina: It's really funny when you uncover different sides of people
	Mina: Especailly one's that are nothing like your impression of them
	Mina: That makes Christine's change of character funnier! 
	Mina: I'm kinda jealous... wish I could've joined you guys!
	Mina: Of course, that's ok!! I'm happy to hear about it from you
=> END
%
	Mina: ...
	- class was really tiring
		Mina: ...
		- miss goes way too fast
			Mina: ...
			- I actually can't keep up
				if Global.chr_meter > Global.ONE_HEART:
					Mina: ...
					- it's nice when I sit with Christine tho
						Mina: 
						- she's really good at explaining the things I miss
				else:
					Mina: ...
					- at least I'm not suffering alone now ig
	Mina:  [$> Global.expression = 'sad']it's really frustrating how fast your teacher explains the material
	Mina: I suggest speaking to her about that, if you feel comfortable to do so
	Mina: after all, a teacher's number one priority is helping their students! [$> Global.expression = 'happy']
	Mina: of course, I'm happy you have your friends with you now!
	Mina: and, I can always help with whatever you're stuck on
	Mina: just let me know when you need help
	Mina: I'm always here for you!
=> END

~ open_up
% 	
	Mina: ... 
	- y'know how I've made new friends?
		Mina: ...
		- actually, are we friends? idk
			Mina: ...
			- anyway...
				Mina: ...
				- idk if they actually like me...
					Mina: ...
					- like, part of me thinks they only talk to me out of pity
						Mina: ...
						- like, maybe they see me as a stray dog or smth
							Mina: ...
							- idk
								Mina: ...
								- people are confusing...
	Mina: ... [$> Global.expression = 'sad'] 
	Mina: I'm sorry to hear that, Violet!
	Mina: people ARE really confusing...
	Mina: you're not the first person to think that 
	Mina: and you're also not the first person to think that people only talk to you out of pity![$> Global.expression = 'happy']
	Mina: so don't be discouraged on your venture to make more friends!
	Mina: the fact that you're still trying despite this hurdle shows how strong you are
	Mina: thank you for sharing your worries with me!
	Mina: I'm certain it'll get easier! 
	Mina: and you'll always have me to fall back on if things get too hard! [$> Global.happiness += 30]
	- thanks, Mina 
		Mina: your welcome!
	- ...
% 
	Mina: ...
	- it's 11pm right now
		Mina: ...
		- mum is still out 
			Mina: ...
			- I'm... kinda worried about her
				Mina: ...
				- like, she hardly tells me anything about how she's doing, y'know
					Mina: ...
					- actually... I guess we hardly speak at all
						Mina: ...
						- I mean, I'm grateful she works so hard and all
							Mina: ...
							- and she doesn't put any stress on me to get a job or smth
								Mina: ...
								- but still, I wish she'd just talk to me, y'know
									Mina: ...
									- I can see it takes a toll on her
	Mina: ... [$> Global.expression = 'happy']
	Mina: your mum does seem to be working very hard!
	Mina: and it is clear she cares about you - as she doesn't put any pressure on you to do the same
	Mina: but, you're still right to feel hurt by this
	Mina: still, I have to say, you're so kind-hearted for understanding your mother's situation!
	Mina: many would come at this situation with anger
	Mina: but you remain understanding and empathetic
	Mina: that shows how considerate you are, Violet!
	Mina: never forget that! [$> Global.happiness += 30]
	- thanks, Mina
	- ...
	Mina: anytime!
=> END